window.products.push({"id":512024,"name":"Polish Pottery Jar with Lid 4-inch Blue Poppies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d8mbF7HRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Jar with Lid 4-inch Blue Poppies Dimensions: 2½\" wide, 2½\" long, 4¼\" high Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51d8mbF7HRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B01N1WKLJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1WKLJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1WKLJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512025,"name":"Snowflake Obsidian Crystal Egg ~48mm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617BP5ClyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All Obsidian is said to be grounding and balancing, rooting our spiritual energy and dissolving negative intention. Snowflake Obsidian is known as a stone of purity. It is said to balance out the body, mind and spirit, it is also good for the skin and circulation. The 'snowflakes' of this obsidian are created by grey feldspar inclusions that form when obsidian crystallises from surrounding lava. The rapid process produces a smooth texture and deep colour that stabilises your room. Our crystal eggs have been carefully shaped and polished to bring out the beatiful colour of the stone. Their tactile shape make it ideal for holding during meditation or placing on the body. Each egg is unique and may vary in colour and pattern. Price shown is for 1 egg.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617BP5ClyvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CrystalAge","source_asin":"B007C34IUG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512025","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007C34IUG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007C34IUG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
