window.products.push({"id":512060,"name":"Porthos Home Aceline Mid-Century Console Table","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rGOdeRJyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Timeless Mid-Century design meets modern functionality with the solid pine Aceline Mid-Century Console Table crafted by Porthos Home. This simple console table is versatile enough to keep anywhere in your home, and can be easily moved from your entryway to your entertainment center. Its solid Pine wood frame provides a strong base while the elegant minimalist construction makes it light weight enough to move as you need. The single drawer provides enough space to store your more personal items, while the open shelf is perfect for mail and magazines. The angled legs make this console lithe and graceful, while the asymmetrical design creates an easy-going tone as soon as you walk through the door.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rGOdeRJyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Porthos Home","source_asin":"B075V2S1J9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075V2S1J9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075V2S1J9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512061,"name":"Kytree Bath Towel Wrap for Women's Microfiber Shower Towel Wraps Bathrobe Fade-Resistant Soft Plush Highly- Quick-Dry Towel Spa, Gym Towel and Dry Hai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b1wLBFgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why use Kytree super soft towel? This 4-piece Towels set by KytreeTowels provides a complete package of washcloths, bath towels, and Dry hair cap towels to meet all your needs. How refreshing it feels to wrap yourself in a soft, absorbent, fluffy bath towel after a warm shower! These towels possess breathable characteristics which make them perfect for your hair and body. Our towels sets aim to keep you clean and dry you off while adding to the look of your bathroom simultaneously. These are much denser, heavier, and super absorbent in nature to deliver the finest of performance at all times. It makes sure that the towels shed minimal lint, keeping them in impeccable form for long. These are perfect for home as well as commercial usage, hence catering to a much larger audience at a time. Have a user-friendly experience with this product in use and enjoy the utilities being offered for an extensive period of time. PREMIUM TOWEL WRAPS Features Material: 80% Polyester + 20% Nylon Terry cloth body wrap Absorbent, soft, and comfortable Size Chart Bath towel: 55*27.5inches Towel:27.5*12.5 inches Dry hair cap: 25.5*9.8 inches Hairband: 7.3*2.6 inches Package list: Bath towel x1 Towel x1 Dry hair cap x1 Hairband x1Gym Drawstring Bags x1 Wash & Care Machine washable, wash in warm water. Tumble dry low heat Wash and dry hook-and-loop fasteners closed Wash shower wrap separately from clothing Avoid using bleach, fabric softeners, and dryer sheets. Bleach breaks down the cotton fibers. Softeners reduce absorbency Adding 1/2 cup of white distilled vinegar to the rinse water will remove any detergent build-up and the lint If you see a pulled loop on your, please cut the pulled loop with a pair of scissors. This will not damage the item","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b1wLBFgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kytree","source_asin":"B08LGWMCRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LGWMCRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LGWMCRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
