window.products.push({"id":512098,"name":"Ginkgo International Burton 5-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DG9AW3vSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description 079914132053 Features: -Versatile design. -Set includes dinner fork, salad fork, teaspoon, dinner spoon, dinner knife. -18/10 Stainless steel. Finish: -Silver. Material: -Stainless steel. Handle Material: -Stainless steel. Number of Items Included: -5. Dimensions: Dinner Fork Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -8\". Dinner Fork Width - Side to Side: -1\". Dinner Fork Depth - Front to Back: -1\". Dinner Fork Weight: -0.181 lbs. Soup Spoon Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -7.5\". Soup Spoon Width - Side to Side: -1.5\". Soup Spoon Depth - Front to Back: -0.75\". Soup Spoon Weight: -0.188 lbs. Knife Overall Height - Top to Bottom: -8.75\". Knife Width - Side to Side: -0.75\". Knife Depth - Front to Back: -0.25\". Knife Weight: -0.344 lbs. Amazon.com An ideal flatware pattern for everyday meals as well as candlelit dinners, Burton is both strong and elegant in a highly contemporary way. The flat handles are quite broad, from the neck down to the squared-off end, offering good heft and balance. The fork tines are traditionally long and slim, but the spoon bowls curve into a more unusual full-moon shape. Most elegant of all is the knife, with its pointed, straight-backed blade complemented by a perfectly arched cutting edge. Made of 18/10 stainless steel for the utmost in corrosion-resistant and luster, Burton is polished to a mirror finish. This single place setting consists of five pieces: a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. A larger 20-piece set of four place settings is also available, as well as such necessities for entertaining as demitasse spoons, cocktail forks, and dip spreaders. Ginkgo flatware is dishwasher-safe, although soaking in water and prolonged exposure to acidic foods should be avoided in order to prevent spotting. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DG9AW3vSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B0BJ1XXB24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ1XXB24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ1XXB24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
