window.products.push({"id":512100,"name":"Soap Dispenser, Automatic Soap Dispenser, 3 Levels Adjustable Soap Dispenser for Kitchen Sink, 13.5OZ Large Capacity Touchless Soap Dispenser, Waterpr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YeWBl3x-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soap Dispenser with Sensitive Infrared Sensor - Our automatic soap dispenser features precise infrared motion sensor detection technology, giving you touchless operation within 0.2 seconds. The sensor range of the touchless soap dispenser is 0-2.36inch/ 0-6cm. You only need to put your hands under the liquid outlet, and the automatic soap dispenser touchless can automatically discharge liquid without contact, which is clean and hygienic. 3 Levels Adjustable Automatic Soap Dispenser - Our soap dispenser for kitchen sink has 3 adjustable soap liquid levels(Level 1: 1.5ML, Level 2 : 2.8ML, Level 3 : 4.0ML). Easily set the desired level by pressing [+/-] control button on the top of the dish soap dispenser to increase or decrease the output. The hand soap dispenser is well-designed, there is no leakage or dripping, and the automatic soap dispenser is more comfortable to use. IPX4 Water-resistant & Anti-leakage Design - The soap dispenser bathroom has a thickened, anti-leakage and anti-slip bottom to keep the body away from water, and the compact structure is effectively waterproof. Even if you turn the bathroom soap dispenser upside down, the hand sanitizer won't come out because the kitchen soap dispenser has wide opening and anti-leakage cover. Our soap dispensers are inspected for quality and there will be no messy drip. Battery Operated Touchless Soap Dispenser - Our liquid soap dispenser is battery powered, which is safer and easier to carry than rechargeable soap dispenser automatic. Our package doesn't contain batteries, so you'll need to prepare 4*AAA batteries, turn the bottom cover of the automatic hand soap dispenser to open and see where the batteries are installed. Besides, our kitchen dish soap dispenser consumes less power even in working condition and has a longer lifespan. Large Capacity and Multi-uses Soap Dispensers - The automatic soap dispenser made of super quality materials is durable and has a long service life. The overall size of the dish soap dispenser for kitchen sink is 5.07’’ x 7.72’’ x 3.78’’, and the capacity of the touchless soap dispenser is 13.5oz/400ml, which is suitable for home, school, office, hotel. There is a transparent container, and you can see the rest volume of liquid soaps at any time and replenish it in time without forgetting it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YeWBl3x-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greechane","source_asin":"B0C2XQ6MVC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2XQ6MVC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2XQ6MVC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
