window.products.push({"id":512174,"name":"VANDHOME Bento Box Adult Lunch Box Set, Portable Keep Warm Lunch Container With Insulated Bag, 18/8 Stainless Steel Thermal Food Container, Induction ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yem3xb+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Lunch Box Set】VANDHOME Portable lunch container set includes stackable lunch boxes*4 (2 Small +2 Large, 68oz), insulated lunch bag*1 and Folding Spoon*1. Convenient for you to enjoy tasty homemade food at school or at work, office, school, picnic, camping or going out.(recommended age: over 3 years) 【Keep Food Warm】The thermal bento lunch box with PU material insulation middle layer and insulated lunch bag usually keeps hot food warm about 2-3 hours. It not only enhances the heat preservation time of the lunch box, but also has a certain function of cold and fresh preservation. 【Induction Cooker & Microwave Safe】Removable design. The lunch box is safe for microwave heating (Refer to the operation method in the picture). At the same time, the stainless steel inner layer can also be taken out separately for induction cooker heating (Pay attention to prevent burns). Multiple heating methods ensure that you can enjoy delicious food anytime. 【Separate Food Storage】The stackable lunch container can store different foods separately according to your preferences and needs. Effectively prevent food from mixing with each other to ensure the original taste of food. At the same time, each lid has a built-in airtight silicone ring to prevent sauces and soups from leaking. 【Food Grade Material】Food container box is made of food grade 18/8 stainless steel internal layer, PU material insulation middle layer and plastic PP external shell. They are reusable, durable, rust-proof, eco-friendly, BPA free and healthy. You can enjoy this hot food without any worries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yem3xb+-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANDHOME","source_asin":"B0BRP61Z34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRP61Z34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRP61Z34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
