window.products.push({"id":512247,"name":"Kochnors Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Large Capacity Up To 85ML USB Rechargeable Salt Pepper Grinder with 6-Level Adjustable Coarseness, Grav","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718hDyHRk2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FOR PEOPLE WITH ARTHRITIS - KOCHNORS automatic salt and pepper grinder set is designed with a gravity function so you can easily grind spices with just one hand. You can also sprinkle delicious spices on your food at the same time, even if you have a spatula in your other hand, just tilt the spice grinder 45 degrees and the spices will be sprinkled on your food as easily as you want. NO MORE BATTERY REPLACEMENT NEEDED - The rechargeable salt and pepper grinder set come with 4 PCS USB RECHARGEABLE external battery You will never need to replace the battery more often, just connect the usb cable with any usb port such as laptop, power bank or phone charger, you can easily charge the gadget and It takes about 3 hours to fully charge, and the charge lasts for about 200 grinds, more eco-friendly and environmentally. 6-LEVEL ADJUSTABLE COARSENESS - This salt pepper grinder set design with 6 level adjustable coarseness from fine to coarse to meet your different needs. No matter for your soup or steak or roast chicken, you will always find a perfect coarseness of the spices for different food, the package come with a little brush to help you clean up the spices hidden in the crevices, clean job is easily as breath. LARGE CAPACITY UP TO 85ML - The KOCHNORS electric salt and pepper grinder set is suitable for kinds of spice and has large capacity for spices storage, one fill with 65g / 85ML spices. Never have to refill the spice more often, saving your time and always get the most fresh spices for your food. LIGHT UP YOUR SPICES EVEN IN THE DARK - With the slightest twist of your wrist, bright and soft light lights up from the gravity grinder salt and pepper shakers, adding a touch of mystery to the otherwise romantic and warm atmosphere, allows you to see exactly where the spices are landing, preventing food from being over-seasoned. 2-PACK ELECTRIC SALT AND PEPEPR GRINDER SET - You will received twopepper grinder in set for holding different spices to avoid mixing up, Suitable for pepper, salt, rosemary, cumin seeds, red pepper, etc. A MUST-HAVE FOR YOUR KITCHEN - Suit for black pepper, white pepper, dried pepper, sesame, sea salt, Himalayan salt, cumin and it's a perfect companion for kitchen, restaurant, party and outdoor picnic. This electric pepper mill grinder comes in beautiful box packaging which is the perfect present for any occasion, and ideal for people suffering from wrist problem. QUALITY AFTER-SALES SERVICE - KOCHNORS provides 24 hours of online service + 12 months additional warranty, if you have any dissatisfaction or questions about the pepper grinder set, please feel free to contact us, and we will do it to your satisfaction!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718hDyHRk2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kochnors","source_asin":"B0BNV7PPKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNV7PPKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNV7PPKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
