window.products.push({"id":512303,"name":"Get It Right Premium Silicone Spatula | Heat Resistant up to 550°F | Seamless, Nonstick Kitchen Spatulas for Cooking, Baking, and Mixing | Ultimate - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t27JssTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The world’s best-reviewed spatulas, GIR’s patent pending tools sport an easy-to-clean design and come in over a dozen kitchen-friendly colors. As with all of our products, we’ve spent time perfecting each size to optimize flexibility and strength. This heavy-duty platinum silicone spatula is heat resistant up to 550°f so it will not discolor, warp, melt, or chip. Our proprietary fiberglass core provides better heat resistance and longer life than cheap iron and stainless steel cores, which heat up the handle and degrade silicone quality. Made to last forever in your kitchen. GIR: Get It Right started with a simple mission: to revolutionize the spatula. We knew that if we designed a product with carefully chosen materials, and uncompromising focus on quality, we would have something worth sharing with the world. Our “get it right” philosophy applies to a complete range of products that are beautiful, functional, and fun. From the Manufacturer The Only Spatulas You'll Ever Need is All-silicone construction, heat-resistant to 550 degrees F, easy to clean, dishwasher and nonstick safe, and nearly indestructible. Lightweight but sturdy, with a comfortable Stay-Cool to the touch handle, these tools were designed for both the occasional cook and seasoned chef. Strong but flexible blades make it easy to maneuver in pots, bowls, pans, and more. Designed for a Lifetime Our platinum grade silicone is non-toxic, BPA-free, environmentally friendly. In other words, you're getting the best. These tools won’t discolor, warp, melt, chip, or scratch your delicate cookware. The proprietary fiberglass core provides better heat resistance compared to cheap metal cores that make the handle hot, degrades silicone quality, and shortens the tool’s lifespan. Super Heat-Resistant These tools are heat-resistant up to 550°F - both the handle and the blade. Why? So the blade won't melt, burn or smoke in a hot pan, and the handle will Stay-Cool to the touch, even if you leave it in the sauce pot for a while. How? We combine one-piece construction with high-heat-rated silicone and a fiberglass core to make all of GIR's super heat-resistant tools. Designed with a Purpose Often imitated but never equaled, GIR’s tools are individually designed for the tasks at hand. Each blade is crafted for optimal flexibility, extending into a strong handle. We eliminated bacteria-trapping joints and holes that come along with two-piece designs. The result? Nearly indestructible tools that are fantastic to look at, and even better to use. Platinum Grade Silicone We only source high quality platinum silicone that meets the most stringent standards of quality control. It’s what we’d want in our own kitchens, and it’s the only thing we’d put our names on. BPA, BPS, and phthalate free. Lifetime Guarantee All GIR products come with a lifetime guarantee — not that you’ll need it. Should your spatula fly too close to the sun, just let us know and we’ll help out in a jiffy. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Essential, Fresh, Simple How did you come up with the idea for this product? We each had a drawer full of spatulas that just didn’t work – melted, burnt, uncomfortable, or hard to clean. So, we set out to perfect a single product – the Ultimate Spatula – with a fresh, simple approach to product design. What makes your product special? We’re not interested in gadgets for gadgets' sake. We want to take something that's always been \"good enough,\" turn it on its head, and make a statement with a new design that solves a problem while making everyone happy at the same time. What has been the best part of your startup experience? That our vision clicked with our customers almost immediately. That “where has this been all my life!?” moment, when someone writes in professing love for something as simple as a spatula. That’s why we’re here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t27JssTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GIR: Get It Right","source_asin":"B0B3N1Z1P5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3N1Z1P5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3N1Z1P5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
