window.products.push({"id":512313,"name":"Ritz Trellis Pattern Reversible Ultra Absorbent Kitchen Dish Drying Mat, Biscotti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9132Mvi2KML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Established in 1892, the John Ritzenthaler company (Ritz) has long been synonymous with the finest quality in home textiles. Today, the John Ritzenthaler company is a privately owned manufacturer, wholesaler and distributor of a complete line of high quality, color coordinated, fashion basic and designer bath and kitchen textiles, as well as, specialty laundry and cleaning aids. As a leader in the home textiles category we are experienced in working on Ritz initiated design concepts, licensed designs and also with interpreting customer requests into new products. Our marketing and design teams work closely together to identify product opportunities within the marketplace to help create the right product mix for our customers. The new Ritz microfiber dish drying mat is a great new alternative to placing hand towels on the counter when hand washing dishes, glassware, pots and pans. These towels are made from 100-percent polyester microfiber, making them highly absorbent and easy to clean. The drying mat acts as a cushion to protect delicate dishes and stemware, while protecting countertops. Each mat features top quilting to ensure easy folding for storage. The Ritz microfiber drying mat is designed with a trellis pattern print side and a coordinating solid color side and measures 21\" x 14\". Machine wash and dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9132Mvi2KML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritz","source_asin":"B00D7EKY66","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D7EKY66","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D7EKY66","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
