window.products.push({"id":512341,"name":"The Grand Full XL Mattress Pad - Fitted Deep Pockets Bed Protection Cover, Quilted Breathable Fabric - Protects Mattresses from Dirt, Dust & Dander (F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810nRDnCgzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY FABRIC AND CONSTRUCTION: Our Grand Mattress pad is exactly that: grand! Our polyester and cotton blend top offers a smooth, soft feel. This mattress pad is a great choice for people who have allergies. PERFECT FIT: With its deep pockets and generously sized corners, this mattress pad will offer a perfect fit every time. It will stay securely on the bed, without bunching, and your sheets won’t slip off the corners like most mattress pads. It’s easy to put on and take off. It can fit over toppers, whether they be gel or memory foam, and can even fit extra-large mattresses! ADDS COMFORT: Add an extra layer of softness to your mattress without adding more bulk. It can help older mattresses feel much more comfortable. The fabric is truly breathable, and won’t make you sweat at night. PROTECTS WHILE YOU REST: Only Quality Fabrics Used, breathable, quilted pattern supports your body while protecting your mattress from stains, dust, dirt and dander. It's also completely noiseless and won't bunch up or make any noise while you sleep. EASY TO CLEAN: Machine wash and dry. Will not shrink after washing. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee. You have nothing to lose, and a good night’s sleep to gain!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810nRDnCgzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THE GRAND","source_asin":"B08247XN6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08247XN6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08247XN6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512342,"name":"Lush Decor Navy Stripe Yarn-Dyed Cotton Window Curtain Set (95\" x 40\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81505tmh9UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of luxury to your home with our Cape Cod Stripe Yarn-Dyed Cotton Window Curtain Panel Pair. These stylish new curtains add delightful pattern to your master bedroom, kids' room, nursery, living room, or office. They feature large horizontal stripes on cotton fabric: the eye-catching navy-and-white curtain panels will not take over the look of the room, but the horizontal stripe pattern will lend stunning sophistication to any space. The neutral color coordinates easily with other colors in your home, so no matter the interior design of your space, whether modern or rustic, these curtains will blend beautifully in your room. Plus, the sheer cotton fabric softens the light that passes through your windows, reducing glare on your TV or computer screen and giving you the privacy you want. Add darkening panels as needed to block out the extra light. To care for these curtains, we recommend cleaning them in the washing machine in cold water with similar colors and hanging to air dry. This will help to maintain the look and feel of these luxurious curtains. Use only non-chlorine bleach as needed. Each striped curtain measures 95\" H x 40\" W, so they are wide and tall enough for most standard windows. Your purchase comes with a pair of curtains. Our design does not include grommets, so you will need clips to hang the curtains on your curtain rod. At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81505tmh9UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B07WT6GMPJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WT6GMPJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WT6GMPJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
