window.products.push({"id":512381,"name":"TIBORANG 8 Inch Non Stick Frying Pan, Heat Indicator Fry Pan, 100% APEO & PFOA-Free Ceramic Coating,Stay Cool Bakelite Handle(Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711+5uybWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳Non-Stick Coating & Healthy Material:This nonstick frying pan is made of four layers of materials. The surface Ceramic coating ensures non-stick characteristics of it. and it's very easy to wash. three internal layers allow this frying pan to heat evenly and more resistant.lead or cadmium. Even above 1000°F, you don't need to worry about material safety. More energy-efficient and less smoky than cast iron. 🍳Preheat Function:The front end of the stir fry pan handle is a temperature indicator. The cold pot is red in front, red change after heating. Oil temperature ≥140℃ will change to white. Just by looking, you can know exactly what time the food is served. Master the heat and prevent nutrient loss.Unlike traditional pans, it allows you to cook with less oil or butter. Ideal for over low to medium heat with less oil or butter for healthy diet.the omelet pan is suitable for 1-2 people. 🍳Stay Cool Bakelite Handle:The handle of this ceramic frying pan with ergonomic design, which stays cool and allows you to easily grip and maneuver the pan when cooking. The 8-inch nonstick fry pan handle end has a perforated design, which is convenient for hanging storage and saving space.You can easily lift the fry pan by the one-hand. This cooking pan is light. suitable do breakfast. 🍳Heat Up Fast:This small frying pan is designed with diamond pattern,With the stainless steel 5-layer compound bottom has fast heat conduction.The heat conduction efficiency can be 3x higher than the efficiency of ordinary pan's bottom,the food will be heat quickly and evenly.so you don't need cook it on a high fire. Prolonged fire will change the coating color.Oven and Dishwasher safe up to 420°F,All cook tops compatibility. 🍳Package & Size: Package Include: 1 x 8\" frying pan, Pot body Size: 20 x 18 x 4.5cm/7.87\" x 7\" x 1.77\"(Top Dia*Bottom Dia*H).Handle Size:6cm/2.23\". Tip:when you first receive the new breakfast non stick fry pan,use warm water or soaf water to clean, avoid using stainless steel scrubbing balls. Then wipe the body of the pot with oil, the coating is more non-sticky.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711+5uybWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIBORANG","source_asin":"B08Y7GC9WC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y7GC9WC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y7GC9WC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512382,"name":"Freckled Sage Cherry Blossom Silver Oilcloth Tablecloth with Black Gingham Trim You Pick The Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9108eYoBmAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This delightful tablecloth is handmade in the USA by Freckled Sage, the oilcloth experts! Using only genuine oilcloth this tablecloth is available in numerous sizes. These square and rectangular tablecloths are finished with gingham trim, which is also oilcloth. You pick the size and color! Don't be fooled by all the imitations, we only sell genuine oilcloth. Perfect for kitchen, picnics, pool side, and patios. Great for parties, holidays! Makes clean up a snap! Simply wipe clean! Measure your table then add the drop you'd like. For example if your table measures 38\" across, and you'd like a 5\" drop, add 10\" to your dimensions. That would give you a finished size of 48\". Then measure the length and do the same. All tablecloths over 48\" wide are french seamed on the sides never down the middle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9108eYoBmAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freckled Sage Oilcloth Products","source_asin":"B01G4EZ6QS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512382","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G4EZ6QS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G4EZ6QS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
