window.products.push({"id":512508,"name":"Hosley Set of 3 Gardenia Fragrance Warming Oils 55 Milliliter. Ideal Gift for Weddings Spa Meditation Settings P1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IJRGAm54L._AC_SL1472_.jpg","description":"Made in the USA! Hosley Set of 3, 55 ml Gardenia Fragrance Warming Oils. Create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere in your home with Hosley warming oils. As the fragrance is dispersed throughout your home it will freshen the air and help assist in removing lingering odors. Use these oils with any electric or candle dispenser (sold separately) to disperse its welcoming fragrance throughout your home. These oils do not produce any wick or soot making an easy clean-up with just a paper towel. With only a few drops, these oils will release a captivating aroma in the air. These fragrance warming oils are environmentally friendly and are highly concentrated. It is even suitable for refreshing dried out potpourri, making it fragrant once again. Try combining two or more scents to create your own enchanting fragrance. Wrap them up as a gift or use them as a stocking stuffer. Spread these fragrances around and share with your family and friends. Instructions: For use with oil warmers only. Use oil as is. Do not dilute. Follow the directions of the oil warmer for amount to be used (DO NOT OVERFILL). Only add oil to a clean warmer that is at room temperature. Caution: Skin and eye irritant. Do not ingest. Keep out of reach of children and pets. May damage finished surfaces if spill occurs. Contains fragrance oils. (Product label may differ).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IJRGAm54L._AC_SL1472_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosley","source_asin":"B07K2HCDS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K2HCDS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K2HCDS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512509,"name":"COMOOO Insulated Water Bottle Leak-Proof Double Walled Cola Shape Cup Stainless Steel Thermos Water Bottle 17oz for Bike Travel Camping (Pink, 8)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyETMsc9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"★★★【Vacuum Insulation】 The 17oz stainless steel water bottles are double-walled and vacuum sealed with an inner copper lining, increasing thermal insulation, which keep beverages cold up to 24 hours and hot up to 12 hours. ★★★【Premium Material】These double wall insulated bottles are made of high quality food grade 18/8 stainless steel, which is BPA free, rust-proof and durable. The easy-cleaning water bottle won't retain or transfer flavors of any beverage. The powder coating on the surface protects the stainless steel water bottle from scratches and dents. No sweat condensation, suitable for hand gripping. ★★★【Portable and Stylish】The lightweight sports water bottle is perfect for caring out, which is easy for grabbing in hand for most people. The cola shape water bottle fits in most cup holders on bicycle or car. The thermal flask with stylish design and color is the best gift choice for your friends and family who love sports and travel. ★★★【Bonus Brush for Easy Cleaning】Our cola shaped water bottle adopts a narrow mouth design for the easy sip and preventing the liquid spilling. Comes a Bonus Cleaning Brush in order to facilitate the cleaning of the inside of the bottle. You can easily put the elongated brush into the bottle to clean the inner wall. ★★★【Perfect Size】COMOOO large drinking bottle with 17oz capacity is perfect for students, office staff and bodybuilder to drink more water easier. Whether you’re running on a trail, riding a bike, having a picnic or playing sports, our water bottles are the best hydration companions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tyETMsc9L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COMOOO","source_asin":"B083BQ3RT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083BQ3RT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083BQ3RT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
