window.products.push({"id":512569,"name":"Warome Butter Holder, French Butter Crock for Counter, Farmhouse Butter Keeper With Water Line French Butter Dish with Lid, Perfect Spreadable Consist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614p4J44uDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Enjoy Soft Butter from the French Butter Keeper Anytime】Use cold water to form an airtight seal between the lid and the jar, which will keep your butter fresh at room temperature. No need to soften hard butter from the refrigerator anymore, use Warome butter holder for counter to enjoy soft and delicious butter anytime. 【Upgraded Version of the Handle, More Stable on the Table】After many trials, the designers of Warome upgraded the handle of the original shorter french butter crock to make the handle area bigger and more comfortable and labor-saving to use. It is also more stable on the table. 【Durable Professional Grade Porcelain Butter keeper crock】The French butter keeper uses the best quality clay, and the surface is equipped with a high-quality glazed surface, which is scratch-resistant. Dishwasher safe; it contains NO lead or cadmium. 【Tips for Keeping Butter Fresh】- Adding a little salt or vinegar to the water is helpful to keep fresh. And please remember to change water in the butter holder each day. 【Environmental Protection Packaging】Warome uses biodegradable pearl cotton to protect the safety of the ceramic butter crock, which is more environmentally friendly and is not easy to be damaged during transportation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614p4J44uDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warome","source_asin":"B0C4HLHLQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4HLHLQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4HLHLQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512570,"name":"FPKOMD 3 Piece Reading Thinker Statue Women Figurine Aesthetic Gold Sculpture Home Decor Accents Modern Abstract Decoration for Bookshelf Shelf Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718QLQMZptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[GOLD DECOR ACCENTS] Our original reading thinker statues are exquisite works of art, with excellent craftsmanship and a stunning aesthetic. Furthermore, they are much larger and stronger than other styles of thinker statues. In other words, they are sturdy and weighty enough to resist toppling even in the event of high winds or slight collisions. [ECO-FRIENDLY MATERIAL] The thinking man statues are crafted from high-quality resin that is smooth, fade-proof, and easy to clean. With a minimalist style, these statues feature clear lines, as well as elegant curves and shapes, making them look high-end in appearance. They would be a beautiful addition to any home and attract many compliments! [ATTRACTIVE DECORATION] Having been carefully polished by our designers, these reading man thinker resin statues have a smooth surface that won't scratch the table when placed on it. As such, they are ideal for placing on a shelf or table. You may enjoy them from any angle you choose (front, side, or back). This set of three statues will certainly draw a lot of attention and stand out whether they are displayed together or separately. [SIZES] Our lovely reading thinkers measure 6 inches tall and 4.3 inches wide, giving you the perfect size to go with any type of decor at your home, office, or workplace. Such beautiful abstract art statues will certainly receive many compliments wherever they are placed. [UNIQUE GIFT] If you are looking for a gift to celebrate a birthday, wedding, anniversary, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Independence Day, etc., then these one-of-a-kind reading thinker statues, which aren't available in local shops, are the perfect presents for your friends and family members.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718QLQMZptL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FPKOMD","source_asin":"B0BJV65P9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJV65P9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJV65P9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512571,"name":"Sulugood Light Filtering Blinds for Windows Cordless 5% Openness Solar Fabric Roller Shades Sheer and Glare Reduce Custom Window Shades for Home Door ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":108.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DtXG9s3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Why Choosing \"Sulugood\" Branded Blinds & Shades】With 26 years history, we always focus on creating a more comfortable home living environment for our customers.Our robust clutch mechanism has been tested 10,000 times in the usual lifting or pulling down tests. We provide free replacement service if the product has quality problems within 12 Months,and the shade can be produced in widths of 23-72 inches and heights of 20-72 inches,also can be manufactured precisely to 1/8 inch for better fit. 【5% Openness Solar Fabric】Compared with the light filtiering shade,ours allow you to enjoy the view outside in addition to its light reducing function. Due to its openness and the way the fabric is woven, it also allows more fresh air to enter and it is more resistant to creasing.Our aluminum tube with three layers, which make the aluminum tube and the fabric's contact surface smoother, reduce the friction of the aluminum tube on the fabric when adjusting the height, more friendly to the fabric 【Safe & Convenient】Our cordless roller shade use an upgraded free stop cordless mechanism, it will be easy to raise and lower the shade,and no need to pull it several times to stop at where you want like traditional retractable blinds, and with a free stop shades there will be no problem of bouncing too fast like the retractable ones.Our roller blinds come with a handle that allows you to stop where you want without touching the fabric,which keeps fabrics from getting dirty easily. 【Quality Fabric】Compared with 1%, 10%, and 14% openness one,choosing a 5% openness fabric allows for a balance between visibility and light blockage.Our fabric is made of a mixture of pvc and polyester, which makes it waterproof and all of our fabrics are carefully selected, will not use poor quality fabrics to bring customers bad experience,compared with the poor quality fabrics, it will be more durable and fade-resistant, which can ensure many years of use. 【Measure Guide of Roller Shades】Inside Mounting roller blinds for windows require a minimum 2\" window frame depth. 【Inside mount】The order height you choose is the height of your window.The width you choose for your order is the width of your window - 1/2 inch. 【Outside mount】You choose the order width and height is your window width + 4 inches, height + 4 inches.If the size you want is not in the list, please contact us for you Custom blinds Size","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DtXG9s3iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sulugood","source_asin":"B0BBLYQPBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512571","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBLYQPBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBLYQPBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
