window.products.push({"id":512589,"name":"Sassy, Waterproof 100% That Turquoise Can Cooler. Durable Neoprene Beer, Soda, Water, or Other Beverage Sleeve. Novelty Drink Coolie is a Great Party ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r9N7BETKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Bad A Coolie for a Bad A Woman Whether it is for a bachelorette party, birthday weekend, or just a night out on the town our can and bottle drink sleeves are sure to get you a ton of laughs and compliments. Let anyone walking up to you know that they're not just talking to anyone... you're 100 percent that witch. The perfect gift for the friend who's got it, flaunts it, and wants everyone to know it. If you walk into every room like you own it. This is the sleeve you need for your drinks. Made from premium materials in a unique turquoise color, our drink cooler is sure to help her stand out even more. Whether you're partying at a pool, clubbing in Vegas, or just hanging with friends at the local bar this coolie will get you noticed. You're 100% That B#%&# and you should be proud of it. Get it girlfriend! What size drink can my sleeve hold and where can I take it? These neoprene can coolers are professionally designed and insulated with 3mm walls to keep 12-ounce beer, wine, soda and seltzer cans cool. Our reusable insulated holders are perfect for alcohol, booze, vino, wines, and other beverages or drinks you enjoy drinking. They're the perfect chillers for your American bbq, beach days, pool days, concerts, parades and more - or when your boozy beverage needs a disguise. How do I keep my coolie clean? Gentle handwashing is highly recommend to keep these big can chillers clean, dishwashers may ruin or decrease the longevity of the cooling covers design and lettering. What’s in the box? You will receive 1x 100% That B blue-green drink sleeves. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r9N7BETKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUCATUS BEST PRODUCTS & GIFTS","source_asin":"B09YD2Q8DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YD2Q8DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YD2Q8DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512590,"name":"SKS Natural Red-Tip Yorker Caps with .030 Orifice Hole (12, Neck diameter 28mm, thread type 410)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jgrabbG2L._AC_.jpg","description":"SKS natural LDPE Yorker spout caps have a .030 hole with a removable red tip. The caps are designed to aid in the dispensing of the container's contents through a hole at the end of the cone-shaped cap. These dispensing caps are great for condiments, glues, paints, and modeling and craft activities How to Measure a Neck Finish: To find a cap's diameter, measure from one side of the inner wall to the opposite side. Calculate a bottle's neck finish by measuring the diameter of the outermost threads. Then see how many times the threads pass one another to determine the finish. (Ex. 24 mm with 1.5 thread turns = 24/410 neck finish.) Note about cap and neck finishes: A container's neck finish holds the cap, stopper, or closure with protruding threads. A container and its corresponding cap must have matching finishes. For example, a 24/400 bottle will only accept a 24/400 closure. Screw thread or continuous thread closure sizes are expressed with two numbers separated by a hypen or slash. The first number refers to the millimeter diameter measured across the inside of the cap's opening or the outside of the bottle's threads. The second number refers to the thread style, \"GPI\" or \"SPI\" finish. The Glass Packaging Institute (GPI) and Society of the Plastics Industry (SPI) are responsible for establishing uniform standardsfor glass and plastic container neck finishes.The closure industry does not necessarily adhere to the same standards,so it is often best practice to purchase containers and capsfrom the same manufacturer when possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jgrabbG2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKS Bottle & Packaging","source_asin":"B01N0BLUBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0BLUBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0BLUBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
