window.products.push({"id":512640,"name":"Cohas Birthday Milestone Board for Dogs with Party Theme and Reusable Chalkboard Style Surface, 12 by 16 Inches, 3 Pastel Markers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I4P+JFMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cohas Chalkboard System Milestone Boards are designed to look like a real chalkboard you can use again and again. These milestone boards are perfect for capturing your fur baby's growth. This special dog birthday board features dog party themed artwork designed in real chalk art, and a smooth, satin chalkboard style surface.This kit comes with three pastel wet-wipe liquid chalk markers. The premium markers feature a chisel 6mm tip, perfect for making thick and thin chalk-like lines about 1/8-inches wide. The markers' wet-wipe ink means they will remove easily with water. When using other markers, certain colors and brands may cause staining; test markers in a small section before writing on your board. Do not use real chalk on this board.Milestone boards are easy to clean and reuse. Add your pet's name, age, favorite treats and toys, and other information and allow to dry. Once your photo shoot is over, use water or a gentle cleaner like Windex to remove your marker's ink. Do not use abrasive cleaners or magic erasers; they will damage the board's surface. Rewrite on the board again and again!The board features real chalk art and a chalkboard embedded onto a hardboard material, then cut to size. Rounded corners are stamped to avoid sharp edges. Finished board measures 12 by 16 inches, by 0.13 inches thick.Ziggyboard has now become Cohas! Still providing the same products and customer service you've come to know and love, but under a new name! And new to the change, Cohas products purchased through authorized resellers come with a one-year warranty!Safe in your home. Markers have the CE mark, meet Toy Safety Regulation EN-41, and bear AP Seal ASTM D4236. Board is GREENGUARD Gold Certified by UL (Underwriter Laboratories), ensuring it is safe for use in environments like schools and healthcare facilities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I4P+JFMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cohas","source_asin":"B086BWXSVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086BWXSVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086BWXSVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
