window.products.push({"id":512644,"name":"BWco. 3- Wick Scented Candles (Cashmere Wool)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j0sMTtiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 3-wick (14.5 oz) candle will burn for approximately 45 hours! Grey Skies- The one that started it all. This candle will have you flying with the wind and leaving imprints in the sky. (citrus + florals + woods + musk + vanilla + tonka bean) Stardust Galaxy- There’s glitter on the floor! Rise to the occasion with this luxurious scented candle. Smells like success up in here. (bold florals + warm amber + musky woods) Far Far Away Eternity- Get blown away to a place where “forever young” is more than just a dream and tomorrow doesn’t come until you say so. (citrus notes + botanicals + exotic wood base) Over The Rainbow Isle- There’s no gold at the end of this rainbow, but you will find peace of mind and space. Let it all go. (watermelon + cantaloupe + honeydew + sea salt + ozone-infused island greens) Watercolors In The Sand- And by ‘water’, we mean vodka. Chilled, please. (floral notes + fruit notes + sandalwood + musk) Fiji Waves- Drift to a place of tranquility and bliss with this vibrant medley of paradise. I think I’ll do nothing today. (water orchid + green coconut + kiwi blossom + tahitian vanilla + pineapple + frangipani + amber) Rosemary Lemonade- This candle is giving summer picnic in the back yard with friends. It’s the perfect blend of Lemon and Rosemary; a wonderful reminder of summer fun! (Lemon + Rosemary) Locker Break Nostalgia- Was that the bell!? What did they have in the cafeteria? Did you hear about….? Got any gum? With this candle, you can smell the chatter of a high school hallway. This one is certain to bring back memories and put a spell on you! (sweet fruit + citrus accords + floral notes + exotic musk base) Cashmere Wool- Kids play in vibrant leaves, clouds dance lightly beneath the sun, and the gentle Fall breeze sends happy thoughts from the back of your mind. This candle is a fragrant reminder to enjoy the simple things in life. (sweet citrus + vanilla + musk + maple + sandalwood).We provide best quality products to the customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j0sMTtiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09FVJP159","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FVJP159","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FVJP159","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
