window.products.push({"id":512799,"name":"Piper Classics Stenciled Flag Throw Pillow Cover, 16\" x 26\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CWKihJcUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton One (1) Accent/Throw Pillow Cover. Actual size of pillow cover is 15\" x 25\" which is designed to fit a 16\" x 26\" pillow insert, not included. 100% cotton, Semi-sheer, unlined, soft creamy white. Cream fabric with charcoal gray printed stars and stripes in United States flag design, distressed printing. Reverses to cream fabric with two wooden buttons to keep the pillow secured within the cover. Machine wash in cold water with like colors, gentle cycle, no chlorine bleach, lay flat to dry, iron if needed. The subtle grey and cream in this United States flag pillow make it easy to show your American pride without the red white and blue fighting with your existing décor! So when you're ready to decorate for Independence Day/Fourth of July, Memorial Day, or just like to show your patriotic spirit and Americana style all year long this pillow eases right in no matter your color scheme.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CWKihJcUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piper Classics","source_asin":"B09VY79ZJ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VY79ZJ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VY79ZJ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512800,"name":"Hoomna Capricorn Birthday Gifts for Women Sister Friend, Graduation Gift for Her","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrgsGu0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Eternal flower? Eternal flower,also called preserved fresh flower,is dried flower made of fresh cut flower such as rose and carnation, processed through a series of complex processes such as dehydration, decolorization, drying and dyeing.It is the most ideal flower processing product for holiday gift, home decoration, celebration, etc. Difference between eternal flower, fake flower and dried flower Preserved fresh flower is made of real flower through High-tech, with the dual characteristics of long time storage of fake flowers and non-toxic and harmless freshness of real flowers. The main feature of preserved flower is that they retain their own tissue and moisture, as well as their color. There is no moisture inside the dried flower, and the color is different from the fresh flowers. Advantages 1: Made from real flowers in nature, with non-toxic and harmless characteristics. 2: Rich in color, can produce colors that are not found in nature. 3: Long preservation time. Preservation time varies with different technologies, currently our technology can make preserved flowers for about 5 years. 4: No watering, no care, easy to take care of. 5: No pollen, no hay fever infection. Maintenance of Eternal flower 1: Please do not water or put them in a humid place. 2: Do not place in direct sunlight. 3: Please do not touch them with your hands often. 4: If there is dust, please use a hair dryer to gently blow off the dust with cold air. You can also use a cotton swab, or a small brush with soft bristles to gently wipe it away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hrgsGu0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoomna","source_asin":"B0B128Q1C4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B128Q1C4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B128Q1C4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
