window.products.push({"id":512829,"name":"National Velour Ballerina Slippers, Fuchsia, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xf-zndaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In our Velour Ballerina Slippers, feet feel better, freer, and more comfortable. Thanks to their soft, cushioned velour uppers, cloth insoles and genuine leather soles, they make the ordinary feel extraordinary - putting a spring in your step no matter what the day has in store. * Soft, cushioned polyester velour uppers * Designed for style - and all-day wear * Absorbent cloth insole * Genuine leather sole * Imported * See colors below * Sizes: S(5-6), M(61/2-71/2), L(8-9), XL(91/2-101/2)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xf-zndaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National","source_asin":"B000JGM49A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JGM49A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JGM49A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512830,"name":"Coffee Canister with Scoop, Airtight Stainless Steel Kitchen Food Storage Container with Date Tracker and Scoop for Beans, Grounds, Tea, Flour, Cereal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EwUmiy85S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What are the problems with preserving coffee beans? 1. We all know that coffee beans tend to lose their freshness after roasting. When they are in contact with oxygen, they are more likely to oxidize, resulting in a sour taste during brewing. 2. When the carbon dioxide released by coffee beans, it is easy to be affected by the coffee beans themselves and destroy their own brewing taste. 3. When the coffee is exposed to the sun and a relatively sultry environment, the coffee beans are easy to sweat and deteriorate. 4. When we buy a new coffee bean, we usually forget the best expiry date. Why choose our airtight coffee can? 1. Our sealed coffee can has a special valve to remove the carbon dioxide in the can, prevent outside air from entering the can, and avoid moisture, heat and light entering the can to accelerate the deterioration of coffee. 2. Our coffee cans have a date recorder, which can record the date when you saved the coffee and the out date, so that you can monitor the freshness of the food. Avoid waste caused by not knowing the shelf life of the food. 3. The free spoon is convenient for you to take out and brew according to the amount at any time, no need to prepare extra spoon for taking. 4.The large capacity of 22 ounces allows you to save a lot of coffee beans storage location, which can be stored centrally. The package contains: 1 x coffee canister 1 x 304 stainless steel scoop 1 x instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EwUmiy85S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIANTRAL","source_asin":"B098K1H8FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098K1H8FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098K1H8FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
