window.products.push({"id":512891,"name":"KEAWELL 20pcs Luxury Mirror Polished Cutlery Set, 18/10 Stainless Steel Tableware, Modern Silverware Set, Includes 8 x Spoons, 8 x Forks, 4 x Knives, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6176EtNmpZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌹HIGH-QUALITY FLATWARE SET: With superior comfort and easy control, our stainless steel tableware comes in a stylish and sleek design that will look elegant and sophisticated on your dinner table. For chic home decor, look no further than this premium cutlery set! 🌹18/10 STAINLESS STEEL TABLEWARE: Our cutlery set was built to last - created to be durable and long-lasting, we've made this set from durable stainless steel that is corrosion-resistant and ensures no loss of shine over time, keeping your family safe and healthy. 🌹DISHWASHER SAFE: Cleaning up after breakfast, lunch, and dinner has never been easier! All of the cutlery in this set of forks, spoons, and knives is dishwasher safe so that you can spend less time in the kitchen, and more quality time with the family! 🌹MIRROR POLISH FLATWARE: Enhance your dining room table decor and turn every meal into a fine dining experience. All products in this modern cookware set are mirror polished to perfection for a sophisticated addition to your table. 🌹IDEAL FOR ANY HOME KITCHEN: Enjoy eating meals with the whole family every day! This 20-piece set is perfect for 4, and with their premium look and sleek design, it's an easy way to add unique pieces to your kitchen accessories that are ideal for everyday use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6176EtNmpZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEAWELL","source_asin":"B09CD26SXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD26SXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD26SXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":512892,"name":"KitchenHusky Ice Tray with Storage Bin, Lid and Scoop for Freezer, Make and Store Ice in One Container, 44 Ice Cube tray, Icecube Maker, Perfect Size ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41J-twisQ5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Experience the KitchenHusky Ice Cube Mold and Freezer Storage Solution- The absolute best, highest quality premium ice cube storage solution available today. Americas #1 premium Ice cube trays mold the perfect ice cubes, perfect for drinks, smoothies, baby formula, and more. Never worry about spills again. The included storage container conveniently fits the included ice cube mold, allowing easy transport from the sink to the freezer without worrying about spilling water. No more tedious balancing of those old ice trays, getting water everywhere. No more funky tasting ice cubes. Our storage container has easy-open lid to keep freezer smells from being absorbed by your ice cubes while allowing easy access to ice. Allows you to place the container wherever you have space in your freezer. Never worry about food contamination or having to place your ice on the top shelf. The lid protects your ice from freezer dangers such as raw meat, chemicals, or evaporation. Convenient Size. 11 x 5.5 x 3 inches allows for use in almost any freezer including small or micro freezers or refrigerators in dorms or offices. Easy-To-Follow Instructions for KitchenHusky Ice Cube Mold and Freezer Storage Solution Step 1: Open and wash tray, container, scoop, and lid with soap and water. Step 2: Fill the tray with your favorite source of water or get creative with flavored mixtures or colors! Step 3: Place filled tray so it fits onto storage bin snugly. Place lid on container and place on any flat area in freezer. Freezing times can vary. Step 4: After freezing, take out the the tray, twist the ends to break the ice free, turn it face-down over the storage bin to empty the cubes, add to your favorite drink and enjoy! Use the included scoop to keep you ice clean and fingers warm!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41J-twisQ5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08SC34R27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-512892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SC34R27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SC34R27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
